      "text": "STRATEGIES\n\n• round-robin\n  Weighted Smooth RR (Nginx algo)\n  currentWeight += effectiveWeight\n  pick max → -= totalEffectiveWeight\n• least-connections\n• ip-hash  (FNV-1 hash mod N)\n• random",
      "fontSize": 25.873668864097365,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STRATEGIES\n\n• round-robin\n  Weighted Smooth RR (Nginx algo)\n  currentWeight += effectiveWeight\n  pick max → -= totalEffectiveWeight\n• least-connections\n• ip-hash  (FNV-1 hash mod N)\n• random",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
