      "updated": 1786391839416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROXY CONTAINER\nimage: pravi2005/reverse-proxy:latest\n\nPorts:\n  8081 (host) → 8080 (container)\n  8443 (host) → 8443 (container)\n\nProcesses inside:\n  Master  (Node.js primary)\n  Worker 1\n  Worker 2\n  Worker 3\n\nVolumes:\n  ./config.yaml → /app/config.yaml\n  ./key.pem, ./cert.pem\n\nextra_hosts:\n  host.docker.internal: host-gateway\n  (reach backends on HOST machine)\n\nnetworks: proxy-network\ndepends_on: redis\n\nDockerfile (multi-stage):\n  Stage 1: node:20-alpine + tsc build\n  Stage 2: node:20-alpine + dist/ only",
      "fontSize": 25.873668864097365,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PROXY CONTAINER\nimage: pravi2005/reverse-proxy:latest\n\nPorts:\n  8081 (host) → 8080 (container)\n  8443 (host) → 8443 (container)\n\nProcesses inside:\n  Master  (Node.js primary)\n  Worker 1\n  Worker 2\n  Worker 3\n\nVolumes:\n  ./config.yaml → /app/config.yaml\n  ./key.pem, ./cert.pem\n\nextra_hosts:\n  host.docker.internal: host-gateway\n  (reach backends on HOST machine)\n\nnetworks: proxy-network\ndepends_on: redis\n\nDockerfile (multi-stage):\n  Stage 1: node:20-alpine + tsc build\n  Stage 2: node:20-alpine + dist/ only",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
