      "updated": 1786391839416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ClusterIP SERVICE\nninja-reverse-proxy-svc\n\nport 8080 → targetPort 8080\nport 8443 → targetPort 8443\n\nType: ClusterIP  (INTERNAL ONLY)\n\n⚠  NOT accessible from internet\n\nTo expose publicly, add one of:\n  Ingress + IngressClass\n  NodePort service\n  LoadBalancer (cloud provider)",
      "fontSize": 25.873668864097365,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ClusterIP SERVICE\nninja-reverse-proxy-svc\n\nport 8080 → targetPort 8080\nport 8443 → targetPort 8443\n\nType: ClusterIP  (INTERNAL ONLY)\n\n⚠  NOT accessible from internet\n\nTo expose publicly, add one of:\n  Ingress + IngressClass\n  NodePort service\n  LoadBalancer (cloud provider)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b5U",
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
