      "seed": 759303900,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 947182638,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• Strict Security Isolation Rule:\n  Evaluates routeHealthyUpstreams = matchedRoute.upstreams.filter(isHealthy)\n• If routeHealthyUpstreams.length === 0:\n  RETURNS 503 SERVICE UNAVAILABLE! (NEVER falls back to global upstreams!)\n• Guarantees total tenant isolation (prevents payment traffic reaching auth/media)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Strict Security Isolation Rule:\n  Evaluates routeHealthyUpstreams = matchedRoute.upstreams.filter(isHealthy)\n• If routeHealthyUpstreams.length === 0:\n  RETURNS 503 SERVICE UNAVAILABLE! (NEVER falls back to global upstreams!)\n• Guarantees total tenant isolation (prevents payment traffic reaching auth/media)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
