      "seed": 896944537,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 323991195,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• Evaluates isAllowed(ip, routeConfig) & getRemaining(ip)\n• SoftLimitPolicy: allows 1.5x burst when current load < softLimit threshold\n• Supports Memory, Redis, and Hybrid storage backends (Fix #9)\n• Injects Redis Lua scripts for atomic single-roundtrip execution without race conditions",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Evaluates isAllowed(ip, routeConfig) & getRemaining(ip)\n• SoftLimitPolicy: allows 1.5x burst when current load < softLimit threshold\n• Supports Memory, Redis, and Hybrid storage backends (Fix #9)\n• Injects Redis Lua scripts for atomic single-roundtrip execution without race conditions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
