      "created": null,
      "text": "⚙️ ALL 5 RATE LIMITING ALGORITHMS (src/ratelimit/algorithms/)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚙️ ALL 5 RATE LIMITING ALGORITHMS (src/ratelimit/algorithms/)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fXyOzbkx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9534,
      "y": -699,
      "width": 5112,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bRTf8w9Ms",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 689363737,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 443988816,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "1. Fixed Window: Map<key, {count, resetTime}> / Redis INCR + PEXPIRE\n2. Sliding Window Log: Map<key, timestamps[]> / Redis ZREMRANGEBYSCORE + ZADD\n3. Sliding Window Counter: Weighted estimate prev*(1-w) + curr / Redis Hashes\n4. Token Bucket: Continuous refill tokens + elapsed*rate / Redis Hashes\n5. Leaking Bucket: Constant drain level - elapsed*leakRate / Redis Hashes\nAll implement IRateLimitAlgorithm interface with exact TTL atomicity and clock skew tolerance.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Fixed Window: Map<key, {count, resetTime}> / Redis INCR + PEXPIRE\n2. Sliding Window Log: Map<key, timestamps[]> / Redis ZREMRANGEBYSCORE + ZADD\n3. Sliding Window Counter: Weighted estimate prev*(1-w) + curr / Redis Hashes\n4. Token Bucket: Continuous refill tokens + elapsed*rate / Redis Hashes\n5. Leaking Bucket: Constant drain level - elapsed*leakRate / Redis Hashes\nAll implement IRateLimitAlgorithm interface with exact TTL atomicity and clock skew tolerance.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7qM3caiU",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 9520,
