      "text": "💾 STORAGE BACKENDS & REDIS CLUSTER INTEGRATION (Fix #9)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "💾 STORAGE BACKENDS & REDIS CLUSTER INTEGRATION (Fix #9)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Sqgm_j4Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9534,
      "y": -419,
      "width": 5112,
      "height": 86,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpLWdTwTj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 816973815,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 107001691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• MemoryStore: Local in-process Map (< 0.05ms fast-path)\n• RedisStore: Redis Cluster client with connection pooling (rlRedisClient)\n• HybridStore: Tiered L1 Memory fast-path + L2 async Redis sync\n  Fix #9: Initializes Redis client for BOTH 'redis' AND 'hybrid' storage!\n  Gracefully degrades to memory-only if Redis cluster is temporarily unreachable.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• MemoryStore: Local in-process Map (< 0.05ms fast-path)\n• RedisStore: Redis Cluster client with connection pooling (rlRedisClient)\n• HybridStore: Tiered L1 Memory fast-path + L2 async Redis sync\n  Fix #9: Initializes Redis client for BOTH 'redis' AND 'hybrid' storage!\n  Gracefully degrades to memory-only if Redis cluster is temporarily unreachable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
