      "text": "📦 CACHE STORES & RFC 7234 POLICIES (src/cache/policies/)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📦 CACHE STORES & RFC 7234 POLICIES (src/cache/policies/)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oZWVtbLK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14834,
      "y": -699,
      "width": 5172,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bvVbs1ugZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 694807822,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 56634305,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• L1 InMemoryLRU: O(1) Map with LRU deletion and TTL expiration\n• L2 RedisCache: Redis client with EX expiration & KEYS pattern deletion\n• KeyBuilder: proxy:METHOD:path (strips query params, appends vary headers)\n• CacheControlParser: max-age, s-maxage, status whitelist (200, 301, 404)\n• StaleWhileRevalidate: serves stale cache while refreshing upstream asynchronously\n• StaleIfError: serves stale cached response on 5xx upstream failure",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• L1 InMemoryLRU: O(1) Map with LRU deletion and TTL expiration\n• L2 RedisCache: Redis client with EX expiration & KEYS pattern deletion\n• KeyBuilder: proxy:METHOD:path (strips query params, appends vary headers)\n• CacheControlParser: max-age, s-maxage, status whitelist (200, 301, 404)\n• StaleWhileRevalidate: serves stale cache while refreshing upstream asynchronously\n• StaleIfError: serves stale cached response on 5xx upstream failure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
