    },
    {
      "id": "62kbzcDR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9534,
      "y": 171,
      "width": 3372,
      "height": 130,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKEchkeTq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 834183997,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 321648359,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• pickFiltered(healthyIds, clientIp, attemptedIds, cookies):\n  1. Filters by routeHealthyUpstreams (strictly isolated!)\n  2. Excludes attemptedIds (prevents retry loops)\n  3. Checks circuitBreaker.isAllowed()\n  4. Prioritizes HALF_OPEN test canary probes\n  5. Checks activeConnections < maxConnections\n  6. Evaluates slowStart weight ramp-up for recovered nodes\n• Mutates activeConnections & EWMA response latency metrics",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• pickFiltered(healthyIds, clientIp, attemptedIds, cookies):\n  1. Filters by routeHealthyUpstreams (strictly isolated!)\n  2. Excludes attemptedIds (prevents retry loops)\n  3. Checks circuitBreaker.isAllowed()\n  4. Prioritizes HALF_OPEN test canary probes\n  5. Checks activeConnections < maxConnections\n  6. Evaluates slowStart weight ramp-up for recovered nodes\n• Mutates activeConnections & EWMA response latency metrics",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
