      "created": null,
      "text": "🔁 FAULT RECOVERY & SRE RETRY LOOP",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔁 FAULT RECOVERY & SRE RETRY LOOP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W6OqsMa6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9534,
      "y": 811,
      "width": 3372,
      "height": 86,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b45SlEKPh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 487671272,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 216856779,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "1. On upstream network error or 502/503/504: lb.recordFailure(id)\n2. Checks globalRetryBudget.recordRetry() -> if ratio <= 15%:\n3. attemptedIds.add(failedId) -> Re-enters lb.pickFiltered() for NEXT candidate!\n4. Transparently retries request up to maxAttempts (default: 2 or 4)\n5. If all retries exhausted: returns 502 Bad Gateway to client.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. On upstream network error or 502/503/504: lb.recordFailure(id)\n2. Checks globalRetryBudget.recordRetry() -> if ratio <= 15%:\n3. attemptedIds.add(failedId) -> Re-enters lb.pickFiltered() for NEXT candidate!\n4. Transparently retries request up to maxAttempts (default: 2 or 4)\n5. If all retries exhausted: returns 502 Bad Gateway to client.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
