      "text": "• Round Robin / Weighted Round Robin (Nginx Smooth Weighted RR algorithm)\n• Adaptive WRR: weight * (1/(1+latency/100)) * (1 - errorRate)\n• Least Connections / Weighted Least Connections (activeConns / weight)\n• Least Response Time (min EWMA latency calculation)\n• Power of Two Choices (P2C: picks 2 random nodes, routes to lower load)\n• Consistent Hashing: 150 virtual nodes per node, 32-bit FNV-1a ring\n• IP Hash / Sticky Sessions (NINJA_ROUTE cookie) / Resource Based (cpu*0.7+mem*0.3)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Round Robin / Weighted Round Robin (Nginx Smooth Weighted RR algorithm)\n• Adaptive WRR: weight * (1/(1+latency/100)) * (1 - errorRate)\n• Least Connections / Weighted Least Connections (activeConns / weight)\n• Least Response Time (min EWMA latency calculation)\n• Power of Two Choices (P2C: picks 2 random nodes, routes to lower load)\n• Consistent Hashing: 150 virtual nodes per node, 32-bit FNV-1a ring\n• IP Hash / Sticky Sessions (NINJA_ROUTE cookie) / Resource Based (cpu*0.7+mem*0.3)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
