      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• Worker 1, Worker 2, Worker 3 (normalized workers ?? os.cpus().length Fix #1)\n• Persistent Connection Pools: httpAgent & httpsAgent (maxSockets: 256, keepAlive: 10s)\n• Request Header Sanitization: strips hop-by-hop, Host rewrite, X-Forwarded-*\n• Upstream HTTP/HTTPS streaming execution via transport.request()\n• Response Decompression (zlib.gunzip) & Client Negotiation (zlib.gzip)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Worker 1, Worker 2, Worker 3 (normalized workers ?? os.cpus().length Fix #1)\n• Persistent Connection Pools: httpAgent & httpsAgent (maxSockets: 256, keepAlive: 10s)\n• Request Header Sanitization: strips hop-by-hop, Host rewrite, X-Forwarded-*\n• Upstream HTTP/HTTPS streaming execution via transport.request()\n• Response Decompression (zlib.gunzip) & Client Negotiation (zlib.gzip)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
