    {
      "id": "ON-j7Crg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16594,
      "y": 171,
      "width": 3372,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDe9W2Olf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 206366429,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 81854875,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• CircuitBreakerManager: Fix #8 clears stale breakers on hot reload!\n• Classic Circuit Breaker: CLOSED -> OPEN (failures >= 3) -> HALF_OPEN (15s)\n• Adaptive Circuit Breaker: Google SRE p(drop) = max(0, (req - 2*acc)/(req+1))\n• SRE RetryBudget: Global 15% budget cap prevents retry storm cascading failure\n• 4 Backoffs: Exponential, Full Jitter, Equal Jitter, Decorrelated Jitter\n• Bulkhead: Limits max concurrent execution slots per upstream",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• CircuitBreakerManager: Fix #8 clears stale breakers on hot reload!\n• Classic Circuit Breaker: CLOSED -> OPEN (failures >= 3) -> HALF_OPEN (15s)\n• Adaptive Circuit Breaker: Google SRE p(drop) = max(0, (req - 2*acc)/(req+1))\n• SRE RetryBudget: Global 15% budget cap prevents retry storm cascading failure\n• 4 Backoffs: Exponential, Full Jitter, Equal Jitter, Decorrelated Jitter\n• Bulkhead: Limits max concurrent execution slots per upstream",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
