      "created": null,
      "text": "• Backend A (http://backend-a:3001) [Weight: 1, MaxConns: 500]\n• Backend B (http://backend-b:3002) [Weight: 2, MaxConns: 500]\n• Backend C (https://backend-c:3003) [Weight: 1, TLS + Custom CA Buffer]\nProcesses actual microservice business logic & returns response stream\nUnder passive health surveillance and circuit breaker monitoring!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Backend A (http://backend-a:3001) [Weight: 1, MaxConns: 500]\n• Backend B (http://backend-b:3002) [Weight: 2, MaxConns: 500]\n• Backend C (https://backend-c:3003) [Weight: 1, TLS + Custom CA Buffer]\nProcesses actual microservice business logic & returns response stream\nUnder passive health surveillance and circuit breaker monitoring!",
