      "seed": 16573905,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 319939511,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "ACTIVE PROBING (active.probe.ts):\n• checkUpstream(): HTTP/HTTPS GET to /health every 10s (5s timeout)\n• Custom CA support & TLS verification; sets status in HEALTHY_UPSTREAMS\n\nPASSIVE PROBING (passive.probe.ts & health.manager.ts):\n• Observes live user traffic responses in real-time\n• 5 errors (>= 500) in 30s sliding window -> trips upstream DOWN passively!\n• Single 200 OK -> immediately revives upstream UP passively!\n• Fix #6: Mutable getter keeps listener bound to active LB across reloads!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ACTIVE PROBING (active.probe.ts):\n• checkUpstream(): HTTP/HTTPS GET to /health every 10s (5s timeout)\n• Custom CA support & TLS verification; sets status in HEALTHY_UPSTREAMS\n\nPASSIVE PROBING (passive.probe.ts & health.manager.ts):\n• Observes live user traffic responses in real-time\n• 5 errors (>= 500) in 30s sliding window -> trips upstream DOWN passively!\n• Single 200 OK -> immediately revives upstream UP passively!\n• Fix #6: Mutable getter keeps listener bound to active LB across reloads!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
