      "updated": 1789874675272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "text": "• MetricsRegistry: Counters (requests, errors) & Gauges (active connections, CPU, RAM)\n• HistogramRegistry: 10 latency buckets (5ms to 5000ms)\n• Cluster Snapshot Aggregation: Master polls workers over IPC & merges snapshots\n• Distributed Tracer: Generates and propagates X-Trace-Id across spans\n• TenantLogStreamer: 10k tenant queue, 1s batch flush over HTTP POST webhooks\n• ReadinessProbe (Fix #7): Deduplicates by name and supports clear() on reload",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• MetricsRegistry: Counters (requests, errors) & Gauges (active connections, CPU, RAM)\n• HistogramRegistry: 10 latency buckets (5ms to 5000ms)\n• Cluster Snapshot Aggregation: Master polls workers over IPC & merges snapshots\n• Distributed Tracer: Generates and propagates X-Trace-Id across spans\n• TenantLogStreamer: 10k tenant queue, 1s batch flush over HTTP POST webhooks\n• ReadinessProbe (Fix #7): Deduplicates by name and supports clear() on reload",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
