      "text": "• Fix #12: Supports both root paths and configured admin.pathPrefix (/__admin/*)\n• GET /__lb-stats: Real-time upstream active connections, EWMA latency, CB states\n• GET /metrics & /__metrics: Cluster-wide Prometheus text exposition (version 0.0.4)\n• GET /__registry: Dynamic service discovery instance statuses\n• GET /__ready & /__health: Subsystem readiness checks (Redis, Upstreams)\n• GET /__cache-stats: L1 memory and L2 Redis hit/miss counters",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Fix #12: Supports both root paths and configured admin.pathPrefix (/__admin/*)\n• GET /__lb-stats: Real-time upstream active connections, EWMA latency, CB states\n• GET /metrics & /__metrics: Cluster-wide Prometheus text exposition (version 0.0.4)\n• GET /__registry: Dynamic service discovery instance statuses\n• GET /__ready & /__health: Subsystem readiness checks (Redis, Upstreams)\n• GET /__cache-stats: L1 memory and L2 Redis hit/miss counters",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
